{"id":"ae1a27a060629395","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-fibred-finite-coproducts.md","title":"纤维有限余积","display":"df-fibred-finite-coproducts — 纤维有限余积","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-fibred-finite-coproducts","display":"df-fibred-finite-coproducts — 纤维有限余积","depends_on":["[[16-df-fibred-preorder]]","[[16-df-substitution]]"],"source":"§1.8; Definition 4.2.1(ii), p. 233 (PDF 253)","revision_date":"2026-10-16","aliases":["16-df-fibred-finite-coproducts"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-fibred-finite-coproducts"},{"key":"display","html":"df-fibred-finite-coproducts — 纤维有限余积"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ddfda06bbcc2ec7b\" href=\"?note=ddfda06bbcc2ec7b\" title=\"16-df-fibred-preorder\">16-df-fibred-preorder</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ccfbb871fa39931c\" href=\"?note=ccfbb871fa39931c\" title=\"16-df-substitution\">16-df-substitution</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"§1.8; Definition 4.2.1(ii), p. 233 (PDF 253)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-fibred-finite-coproducts</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ddfda06bbcc2ec7b\" href=\"?note=ddfda06bbcc2ec7b\" title=\"16-df-fibred-preorder\">16-df-fibred-preorder</a> 的预序纤维化；沿 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u:I\\to J\">\\(u:I\\to J\\)</span> 的重索引 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u^*\">\\(u^*\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ccfbb871fa39931c\" href=\"?note=ccfbb871fa39931c\" title=\"16-df-substitution\">16-df-substitution</a>。</li>\n<li>本页展开该预序的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_I\">\\(\\leq_I\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\simeq_I\">\\(\\simeq_I\\)</span> 记号；它们的对象域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I\">\\(\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FibFinCoprod}(p)\">\\(\\mathrm{FibFinCoprod}(p)\\)</span> 在下文定义。</li>\n<li>候选族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b=(b_I)_I\">\\(b=(b_I)_I\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v=(v_I)_I\">\\(v=(v_I)_I\\)</span> 以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\">\\(I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\\)</span> 为索引；其各分量的对象域、函数域在同一存在量词内规定。</li>\n<li>末尾的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot_I,\\vee_I\">\\(\\bot_I,\\vee_I\\)</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FibFinCoprod}(p)\">\\(\\mathrm{FibFinCoprod}(p)\\)</span> 成立并选定上式同一见证族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(b,v)\">\\((b,v)\\)</span> 后使用；这些记号由 Assertion 的末式定义，不参与存在式本身的前提。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nX\\leq_IY&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E_I}(X,Y)\\ne\\varnothing,\\\\\nX\\simeq_IY&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow X\\leq_IY\\land Y\\leq_IX.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nX\\leq_IY&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E_I}(X,Y)\\ne\\varnothing,\\\\\nX\\simeq_IY&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow X\\leq_IY\\land Y\\leq_IX.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FibFinCoprod}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow(\\exists b,v)\\Bigl[{}&amp;\n(\\forall I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\\\nb_I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I\\land\nv_I:(\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I)^2\\to\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I)\\ b_I\\leq_IX\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\forall X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I)\\Bigl[\nX\\leq_Iv_I(X,Y)\\land Y\\leq_Iv_I(X,Y)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land(\\forall Z\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I)\n\\bigl(X\\leq_IZ\\land Y\\leq_IZ\\Rightarrow v_I(X,Y)\\leq_IZ\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\forall u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal B}(I,J))\\ u^*b_J\\simeq_Ib_I\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\forall u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal B}(I,J))\n(\\forall X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_J)\\\nu^*v_J(X,Y)\\simeq_Iv_I(u^*X,u^*Y)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FibFinCoprod}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow(\\exists b,v)\\Bigl[{}&amp;\n(\\forall I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\\\nb_I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I\\land\nv_I:(\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I)^2\\to\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I)\\ b_I\\leq_IX\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\forall X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I)\\Bigl[\nX\\leq_Iv_I(X,Y)\\land Y\\leq_Iv_I(X,Y)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land(\\forall Z\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I)\n\\bigl(X\\leq_IZ\\land Y\\leq_IZ\\Rightarrow v_I(X,Y)\\leq_IZ\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\forall u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal B}(I,J))\\ u^*b_J\\simeq_Ib_I\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\forall u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal B}(I,J))\n(\\forall X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_J)\\\nu^*v_J(X,Y)\\simeq_Iv_I(u^*X,u^*Y)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bot_I\\coloneqq b_I,\\qquad X\\vee_IY\\coloneqq v_I(X,Y).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bot_I\\coloneqq b_I,\\qquad X\\vee_IY\\coloneqq v_I(X,Y).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>对任一见证族，常把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_I\">\\(b_I\\)</span> 写成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot_I\">\\(\\bot_I\\)</span>、把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_I(X,Y)\">\\(v_I(X,Y)\\)</span> 写成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\vee_IY\">\\(X\\vee_IY\\)</span>。这些选择贯穿所有保持性条件，尚未证明存在前不把它们作为前提。</li>\n<li>本页是原书逻辑章节的预序版本；双向不等式表示同构，不能换成对象记录相等。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vee_I\">\\(\\vee_I\\)</span> 是纤维内析取，跨纤维的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 是另一结构。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, §1.8；Definition 4.2.1(ii), p. 233（PDF 第 253 页）。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-fibred-preorder","status":"resolved","id":"ddfda06bbcc2ec7b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-fibred-preorder]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"ccfbb871fa39931c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibred-preorder","status":"resolved","id":"ddfda06bbcc2ec7b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为 [[16-df-fibred-preorder]] 的预序纤维化；沿 $u:I\\to J$ 的重索引 $u^*$ 采用 [[16-df-substitution]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"ccfbb871fa39931c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为 [[16-df-fibred-preorder]] 的预序纤维化；沿 $u:I\\to J$ 的重索引 $u^*$ 采用 [[16-df-substitution]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"u:I\\to J","display":false},{"tex":"u^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\simeq_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FibFinCoprod}(p)","display":false},{"tex":"b=(b_I)_I","display":false},{"tex":"v=(v_I)_I","display":false},{"tex":"I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot_I,\\vee_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FibFinCoprod}(p)","display":false},{"tex":"(b,v)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nX\\leq_IY&\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E_I}(X,Y)\\ne\\varnothing,\\\\\nX\\simeq_IY&\\Longleftrightarrow X\\leq_IY\\land Y\\leq_IX.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FibFinCoprod}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow(\\exists b,v)\\Bigl[{}&\n(\\forall I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\\\nb_I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I\\land\nv_I:(\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I)^2\\to\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I\\\\\n&\\land(\\forall I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I)\\ b_I\\leq_IX\\\\\n&\\land(\\forall I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\forall X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I)\\Bigl[\nX\\leq_Iv_I(X,Y)\\land Y\\leq_Iv_I(X,Y)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land(\\forall Z\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I)\n\\bigl(X\\leq_IZ\\land Y\\leq_IZ\\Rightarrow v_I(X,Y)\\leq_IZ\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\\\\n&\\land(\\forall I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\forall u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal B}(I,J))\\ u^*b_J\\simeq_Ib_I\\\\\n&\\land(\\forall I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\forall u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal B}(I,J))\n(\\forall X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_J)\\\nu^*v_J(X,Y)\\simeq_Iv_I(u^*X,u^*Y)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\bot_I\\coloneqq b_I,\\qquad X\\vee_IY\\coloneqq v_I(X,Y).","display":true},{"tex":"b_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot_I","display":false},{"tex":"v_I(X,Y)","display":false},{"tex":"X\\vee_IY","display":false},{"tex":"\\vee_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false}],"bytes":2767,"backlinks":[{"id":"e8285984e352a6ff","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为纤维化；正则性和纤维有限余积见 [[16-df-regular-fibration]]、[[16-df-fibred-finite-coproducts]]。"},{"id":"6fdaaa990a4fe51a","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ClosedCompr}$、$\\mathrm{FibPre}$、$\\mathrm{FibCCC}$、$\\mathrm{FibFinCoprod}$、$\\mathrm{Generic}_q$ 分别采用 [[16-df-closed-comprehension]]、[[16-df-fibred-preorder]]、[[16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed]]、[[16-df-fibred-finite-coproducts]]、[[16-df-generic-object]]；$\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p$ 见 [[16-df-cartesian-morphism]]。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-category]]、[[16-df-functor]]、[[16-df-natural-transformation-definition]]、[[16-df-adjoint-functors]]、[[16-df-finite-limits]]、[[16-df-pullback-square]]、[[16-df-subobject-classifier]]、[[16-df-elementary-topos]]、[[16-df-nno]]、[[16-df-fibre]]、[[16-df-fibred-finite-products]]、[[16-df-fibred-finite-coproducts]]、[[16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed]]、[[16-df-fibre-finite-limits]]、[[16-df-finite-product-preserving-functor]]。"},{"id":"4d7b1b6f9345e344","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E_I\\times\\mathcal E_I$ 使用 [[16-thm-product-sum-adjoint]] 的六元组积范畴。$\\Delta_I,\\sqcup_I,\\sqcap_I$ 的两个分量由下式定义；$X,Y,X',Y'\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I$，$f:X\\to X',g:Y\\to Y'$ 为垂直箭头。$X\\vee_IY,X\\wedge_IY$ 采用 [[16-df-fibred-finite-coproducts]]、[[16-df-fibred-finite-products]] 的同一选择；预序性保证末两项单元素集合的唯一性。$\\dashv_\\epsilon$ 采用 [[16-df-adjoint-functors]]。"}],"outgoing":["ddfda06bbcc2ec7b","ccfbb871fa39931c"]}